### 异步导出（需 Bearer，见 samples/_login.http）
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = <paste_access_token>

### 出勤导出任务
POST {{base}}/admin/export/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class_id": null,
  "start_date": "2026-03-01",
  "end_date": "2026-03-31",
  "format": "xlsx"
}

### 学生名册
POST {{base}}/admin/export/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class_id": null,
  "status": 1,
  "format": "xlsx"
}

### 成长记录
POST {{base}}/admin/export/growth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "class_id": null,
  "start_date": "2026-03-01",
  "end_date": "2026-03-31",
  "format": "xlsx"
}

### 查询任务（将 :tid 换为上一响应 data.task_id）
GET {{base}}/admin/export/export_replace_me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 下载（将 :tid 换为 task_id）
GET {{base}}/admin/export/download/export_replace_me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
